Description: A collection of tools for researchers interested in carrying out
    parametric estimation of learning curves and device effects based on
    the publication by Ssemaganda et al. (2025) <doi:10.2147/MDER.S520191>
    with modified versions of propensity score matching (PSM) and
    inverse probability of treatment weighting (IPTW).
